            "english": "Do you want a taxi or to take the metro?"
          },
          {
            "speaker": "B",
            "hanzi": "先坐公交车到车站，再坐地铁。",
            "pinyin": "Xiān zuò gōngjiāochē dào chēzhàn, zài zuò dìtiě.",
            "english": "First I’ll take the bus to the station, then the metro."
          }
        ]
      },
      "patterns": [
        {
          "id": "pattern-1",
          "title": "A journey with transfers",
          "explanation_en": "Use 先 (xiān) and 再 (zài) to describe successive stages of a trip: first one vehicle, then another.",
          "examples": [
            {
              "hanzi": "从酒店到车站要走多远？",
              "pinyin": "Cóng jiǔdiàn dào chēzhàn yào zǒu duō yuǎn?",
              "english": "How far is it to walk from the hotel to the station?"
            },
            {
              "hanzi": "对，我的机票已经买好了。",
              "pinyin": "Duì, wǒ de jīpiào yǐjīng mǎi hǎo le.",
              "english": "Yes, I’ve already bought my plane ticket."
            }
          ],
          "pattern_hanzi": "先 + 第一个动作，再 + 第二个动作",
          "pattern_pinyin": "xiān + dì yī ge dòngzuò, zài + dì èr ge dòngzuò",
          "pattern_pseudo_translation": "先 + <action A>，再 + <action B>"
        },
        {
          "id": "pattern-2",
          "title": "Travel tickets and destinations",
          "explanation_en": "机票 (jīpiào) is an air ticket; 票 (piào) is a general ticket. Use 去 (qù) followed by the destination.",
